 4. 🗡️ 1 for the road: Sith saber for sale 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Darth Vader poses at a New York event in 2024. Photo: Evan Agostini/Invision/AP A Darth Vader lightsaber prop used in the iconic scene where Vader tells Luke Skywalker "I am your father" is among the highlights of an upcoming Star Wars memorabilia auction.

 The Vader saber is expected to fetch at least $1 million. It's one of more than two dozen lightsaber props featured in the Nov. 12 auction.

 Others include dueling lightsabers wielded by Ewan McGregor's Obi-Wan Kenobi and Hayden Christensen's Anakin Skywalker in "Revenge of the Sith," expected to go for at least $10,000 each. Go deeper . 

 
 
